    "semantic_summary": "CameraFlyBehaviour implements a sophisticated, free-look camera controller, enabling fluid navigation via keyboard (WASD/QE) and mouse input. It manages velocity, acceleration, and dampening for smooth movement in 3D space. The component handles both perspective and orthographic camera modes, where input translates to translation or zoom, respectively, modifying the parent entity's Transform."
  },
